WEBVTT

00:00:00.225 --> 00:00:03.000
You paid for months of dance lessons.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
You showed up after work. You practiced at home.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.650
In class, you could follow the steps.

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.983
Then you’re at a wedding. A friend holds out her hand.

00:00:11.983 --> 00:00:13.300
You want to get up.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.666
And suddenly, you can’t think of a single move.

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:19.433
So you smile and say, “Maybe later.”

00:00:20.391 --> 00:00:23.769
The next song comes on, and you’re still in your chair, thinking,

00:00:23.947 --> 00:00:27.959
“After all that time and money…
why do I still feel so lost?”

00:00:28.187 --> 00:00:30.287
That’s why I created Dance Floor Ready.

00:00:30.397 --> 00:00:32.377
I’m opening it as a 30-day pilot.

00:00:32.537 --> 00:00:33.687
Here’s the challenge:

00:00:33.807 --> 00:00:36.267
I’ll coach you personally
so when the music comes on,

00:00:36.477 --> 00:00:39.327
you can find the beat, make your first move,
and keep going.

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:40.273
I’m Ceech.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.308
I’ve been teaching dance since 1998.

00:00:42.498 --> 00:00:44.608
A lot of people come to me
after spending months

00:00:44.723 --> 00:00:46.598
in classes with other instructors.

00:00:46.663 --> 00:00:48.093
They learned how to follow a routine.

00:00:48.323 --> 00:00:50.253
But then a song comes on
at a wedding or party,

00:00:50.253 --> 00:00:51.998
nobody’s leading, and they think,

00:00:52.453 --> 00:00:53.853
“I still don’t know what to do.”

00:00:54.433 --> 00:00:55.413
Does that sound like you?

00:00:55.563 --> 00:00:57.773
If it does, this pilot is for learning

00:00:57.938 --> 00:00:59.883
how to start moving
when no one is leading.
